error[unguarded-release]: lock stays held when this statement throws
 --> src/UnguardedReleasePositive.jl:6:18
  |
5 |     lock(cache_lock)
  |     ---------------- acquired here
6 |     cache[key] = parse(Int, key)
  |                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ may throw while lock is held
  |
  = why: throw skips release; lock or semaphore slot stays held, so next caller waits forever
  = fix: hold with `lock(l) do … end` or `@lock l expr`, or release in `finally`   [manual]
  = docs: corset explain unguarded-release
  = note: deny from correctness group, library preset
  = note: opt out with `# corset: allow unguarded-release -- <reason>`

