error[unguarded-release]: file stays open when this statement throws
  --> src/UnguardedReleasePositive.jl:20:5
   |
19 |     io = open(path, "w")
   |     -------------------- opened here
20 |     write(io, data)
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ may throw while file is open
   |
   = why: throw skips `close`; file stays open until garbage collector finalizes it
   = fix: use `open(path) do io … end`, or close in `finally`   [manual]
   = docs: corset explain unguarded-release

